title: "Weak-signal membership pipeline: topic model, sixteen indicators and four configurational memberships"
version: v2.4.1
date-released: 2026-09-30
authors:
  - family-names: Borowski
    given-names: Ben-Nicholas
    affiliation: University of Vienna
