    description: "Concept DOI; resolves to the latest version. Version DOIs are listed on the Zenodo record."
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a membership-based characterisation of weak signals in
  scientific literature. The pipeline builds a topic model of a Web of Science
  corpus (SBERT, UMAP, HDBSCAN, c-TF-IDF), computes sixteen bibliometric
  indicators across five dimensions and assigns each topic four continuous
  memberships for the configurations Weak Signal, Trend, Emerging Concept and
  Latent. It includes the cross-phase topic matching, the sensitivity analyses,
  the perturbation experiment and the null models. The bibliographic records are
  licensed and not part of the repository.
keywords:
  - weak signals
  - foresight
  - bibliometrics
  - topic modelling
  - emerging topics
